      374.01
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause inserts the new section 68A in the Mortgage Act (Chapter 89), and the legal effect of that section is to limit the applicability of Part III of the Mortgage Act in relation to movable property upon coming into operation of the Secured Transactions Act, No. of 2019.",
